ount EVERY ISS') is stated but not implemented: 667 of 884 executed non-accruing ISS since 2020 carry exercise_ratio = 0.0, so the roll-forward is a no-op on exactly the class the discovery is about, while still flipping the method label to ISS_ESTIMATE. The 12/12 PASS does not contradict this — the suite contains no zero-ratio event and its control leg is entirely event-free. The author's instinct not to wire the file was right and is the only reason nothing downstream is broken; it should now become a hard block plus a redesign rather than a wider reconciliation."}
